# SkillOrbit Environment Configuration

# FastAPI Backend Service URL
# When set, SkillOrbit routes agent requests to your FastAPI backend.
# When left empty, SkillOrbit runs in isolated Client-Side AI Agent DEMO Mode,
# enabling full end-to-end evaluation, adaptive question routing, and dossier generation.
# Example: http://localhost:8000
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
